{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lake of Darkness is an atmospheric visual novel psychological thriller inspired by games such as Milk Inside a Bag of Milk, Omori, And the Don't Escape trilogy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your small town is coming to grips with multiple mysterious disappearances you get a premonition in a dream that you are destined to die in three days. The game reacts to the choices you make.\u00a0 Will you hide from your fate? Spend your last few days with loved ones?\u00a0 Try to break the cycle? Or rediscover the secrets of your past?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828370/extras/62dd1188117af5481f97bf2c97913d11.avif?t=1769387190\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828370/extras_big/62dd1188117af5481f97bf2c97913d11.avif?t=1769387190 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed in Renpy, this game is the first major project from a solo developer. In Lake of Darkness you follow a teenager as they try to understand the strange town they live in and defeat an inescapable ominous pursuer. Taking place over 3 days you have limited time to prepare for their arrival and to understand the mysteries surrounding these strange creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 12 collectable items</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35+ unique endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack with 30 atmospheric songs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching story with a dialogue script over 8000 lines long</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Repeatable minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive 2D pixel art environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&amp; many horrific fates to discover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828370/extras/07dd4bc526af4618c5f2e26ea99a0256.avif?t=1769387190\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"closure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828370/4d30d92f6529e54c31f76c78280001765fc8f203.jpg"},{"name":"lazy bones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828370/37f68583c3c43c5505461e94c67adf4e245ca3f1.jpg"},{"name":"abandonment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828370/bd990f590ec335ec7dc7961ce90e6210f5860814.jpg"},{"name":"harsh truths","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828370/631f17802798170614eee516c1f36f7da95079f8.jpg"},{"name":"until it stops","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828370/0eee6dad7456db865dc5b72d88b8c15c28031b1b.jpg"},{"name":"knock knock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828370/3c52429a59fb54e45afa2ecd7696b3d9ec4821a7.jpg"},{"name":"father son bonding","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828370/2e7643b263e1ab9d716195ec547a3eaea0e0a672.jpg"},{"name":"early bird","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828370/9dd7258ac001f3a15b3208643a8d17a7a8c165fd.jpg"},{"name":"sleepover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828370/c8593e54a4701eb965ed5b314162172364c3c4a0.jpg"},{"name":"reunion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3828370/aae6698af26510de4376d61f469397de118045d4.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic